# NOTE (M08): packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts *is* committed
# and is generated from these directories, so a clone that lacks them will
# regenerate that file without the corresponding chain entry. See the M08
# section of RUNNING-GATES.md before running a deploy.
